{"id":"422339","name":"豆腐丸子","author":"乐：在吃","authorId":"6203817","desc":"","cover":"images/422339/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"豆腐","amount":"150克"},{"name":"芹菜","amount":"100克"},{"name":"虾皮","amount":"30克"}],"sub":[{"name":"盐","amount":"适量"},{"name":"黑胡椒","amount":"适量"},{"name":"蚝油","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"芹菜嫩叶、细杆焯水。","img":"images/422339/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"豆腐蒸熟。","img":"images/422339/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"准备虾皮。","img":"images/422339/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"芹菜切碎备用。","img":"images/422339/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"豆腐用刀压成泥。","img":"images/422339/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"豆腐泥、芹菜碎、虾皮混合。","img":"images/422339/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"添加盐、蚝油、黑胡椒粉调味。","img":"images/422339/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"混合均匀。","img":"images/422339/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"披萨盘倒油并转均。","img":"images/422339/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"团成丸子，多摔打几次，排出空气，便于成型及紧实。","img":"images/422339/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"放入煮锅里隔水蒸。","img":"images/422339/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"蒸好的豆腐丸子。","img":"images/422339/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"高汤。","img":"images/422339/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"加盐调味。","img":"images/422339/step_14.jpg"},{"step":15,"desc":"加入蒸好的豆腐丸子。","img":"images/422339/step_15.jpg"},{"step":16,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/422339/step_16.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：蒸锅、煮锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}